  Tally Backend  →  http://localhost:3003
  GET  /api/versions           (list all versions)
  GET  /api/versions/:id       (get version by id)
  GET  /api/http/read-tally    (latest version)
  GET  /api/http/read-tally/fresh  (fresh from CPI with metadata)
  POST /api/ingest            (ingest from external middleware)
  POST /api/push               (generic push)
  POST /api/push/ledgers       (ledgers push)
  POST /api/push/vouchers      (vouchers push)
  POST /api/push/stock-items   (stock push)
  POST /api/refresh            (trigger refresh)
  GET  /api/health             (health check)
